{"id":"wb-2-7","name":"白求恩模范病室旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"白求恩模范病室旧址","text":"白求恩模范病室旧址，位于山西省忻州市五台县耿镇镇松岩口村，是第二批全国重点文物保护单位的革命遗址及革命纪念建筑物之一。病室由寺庙改建而成，是典型的四合院，共建有三所正厅、四所耳房和七所房屋，在中国抗日战争时曾经是白求恩执业的地方，因被侵华日军焚毁而在1974年重建。白求恩模范病室旧址在1982年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E6%B1%82%E6%81%A9%E6%A8%A1%E8%8C%83%E7%97%85%E5%AE%A4%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93353610,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93353610","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a2fdbbcd7168c675e7ace508.jpg","title":"Site_of_Bethune_Model_Hospital,_2020-09-10_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Site_of_Bethune_Model_Hospital,_2020-09-10_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/Site_of_Bethune_Model_Hospital%2C_2020-09-10_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​白求恩模范病室旧址","width":320,"height":214}}